      "changelog": "https://github.com/winters27/octo/releases",
      "suggestedVersionCode": "918",
      "description": "Octo plays the music on your own server. It is made for Octo, a proxy that adds discovery to a Navidrome server, and it works with any Subsonic server too.\n\nWith Octo:\n\n* Add songs, albums and search results you find to your library with one press.\n* One search for everything: your music first, then what Octo found, all playable at once.\n* Whole albums, with the songs you have marked and the rest one press away.\n* Stations on Home, and radio that reaches past your library.\n\nWith any Subsonic server, it is a full player for the music you have: browse by artist, album, song, genre or folder, with favorites, ratings and playlists; synced lyrics, gapless playback, an equalizer with presets, ReplayGain and a sleep timer; and a queue that follows you between your phone and computer.",
      "issueTracker": "https://github.com/winters27/octo/issues",
